# Applied to docker/Dockerfile with the repository root as build context.
**/.git
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/build
**/install
**/log
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*venv*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.swp
**/*~
# Recorded sensor data and generated maps are not source dependencies.
**/PCD
**/*.bag
**/*.db3
**/*.mcap
**/*.ply
# Keep vendor SDK libraries (.a/.so); Unitree links against them.

